  "details": "While chilling with a friend in an invite+ after a little while it will bug out. I (instance Owner) will accept join requests but they can't join and invites I send out aren't received. My friend in instance will not be able to send invites either, despite verifying it is Invite+. On top of that we aren't able to put down portals or join any other instance, leading to being 'softlocked' in that instance and having to restart our games.\n\nIt has happened 2x in \"Goodnight Sleep (Cabin)\" by Kristinee28 and at least once in \"Cozy Calm\" by ~Sam leading me to believe it isn't world specific. I believe that all these instances were East US Servers however since I'm from New Jersey and he's from Florida. Me and him are both Quest-PC users. I'm Q2 air linked SteamVR and He's Q3 link cable SteamVR",
